        ("<th scope=\"col\">Access</th>", "<th scope=\"col\">アクセス</th>"),
        ("<th scope=\"col\">Report</th>", "<th scope=\"col\">報告書</th>"),
        ("<th scope=\"col\">Archived</th>", "<th scope=\"col\">アーカイブ</th>"),
        ("`Showing ${fmt(d.count)} of ${fmt(d.total)} filings across ${fmt(d.company_count)} companies (${fmt(d.archived_count)} archived).`",
         "`${fmt(d.company_count)} 社の提出 ${fmt(d.total)} 件中 ${fmt(d.count)} 件を表示（${fmt(d.archived_count)} 件アーカイブ済み）。`"),
        ("“New York social-media Terms-of-Service reports, via the Transparency Report API (catalogue version ${d.version}).”",
         "“ニューヨーク州ソーシャルメディア利用規約報告書（Transparency Report API 経由、カタログバージョン ${d.version}）。”"),
